  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Color in Your Cheeks** (1 other source): Audience voted on Matt Douglas's instrument; saxophone led the vote, then he revealed he would play flute [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Clemency for the Wizard King**: back after 41 archived shows (965 days) [3]\n- **Estate Sale Sign**: back after 40 archived shows (960 days) [3]\n- **Liza Forever Minnelli**: back after 42 archived shows (965 days) [3]\n- **Alpha Sun Hat**: back after 78 archived shows (1503 days); rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **Source Decay**: back after 40 archived shows (960 days) [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mountaingoats2022-07-09** (recommended): source not stated; 21 songs; 100 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Encore [1]\n- First night of a duo tour: John Darnielle on acoustic guitar and keyboard, Matt Douglas on guitar, keyboard, saxophone and flute [1]\n- Reviewer found the duo format intimate, which emphasized the fanbase's sense of community [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mountaingoats2022-07-09**: source: ZOOM H1 (48kHz 24bit WAV) [1]. Also: Recorded on a Zoom H1 at 48kHz 24-bit WAV, then SD card, Audacity, and FLAC [1]",
